{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_3617aa9a0f3f2b2a-1477\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>米雪日前迎來71歲生日，並相約一班圈中好友聚會慶生，就連極少露面的伍衛國亦有現身。怎料這場溫馨的聚會，竟意外傳出「婚訊」烏龍，網上瘋傳米雪與伍衛國「官宣婚訊」的消息，好友劉緯民得知後，隨即找來米雪拍片澄清。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c6caab20-f4f7-4321-9a4a-5ae1d27cb7fb.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20260o72WcFPbM1788920027.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c6caab20-f4f7-4321-9a4a-5ae1d27cb7fb.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_3617aa9a0f3f2b2a-1478\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>原來劉緯民是從夏雨口中得知這宗「婚訊」，更打趣笑言要與夏雨爭做「花仔」：「嗰啲傳聞話佢結婚，我同夏雨兩個就馬上話，如果係真嘅事，我哋即刻做『花仔』，加埋百幾歲！」隨後他又向米雪喊話：「你快啲澄清下先，哈哈哈哈哈哈」！</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_3617aa9a0f3f2b2a-1478\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6e91b03b-6e11-40f8-9b5f-13bef0b157e3.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026kd5HTLStoG1788920026.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6e91b03b-6e11-40f8-9b5f-13bef0b157e3.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_3617aa9a0f3f2b2a-1479\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>自摯愛尹志強（尹佬）於2010年病逝後，米雪一直單身至今。對於被傳出與老友結婚，米雪大方表示這類報導其實經常出現：「其實呢，成日都有報道喇，一年我就『嫁一次』」，身旁好友聽罷隨即反問：「嫁得咁頻？」，雙方互動十分搞笑。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_3617aa9a0f3f2b2a-1480\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>對於無辜捲入風波的伍衛國，米雪亦替老友感到冤枉與抱不平。她指出對方向來低調，自己是花盡心思、好不容易才說服對方出席聚會，沒想到最終又被傳出緋聞：「我好辛苦先叫到佢出嚟，我哋可唔可以成班老友一齊食一餐飯，最終又寫咗啲嘢……」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_3617aa9a0f3f2b2a-1480\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5d1c312f-fc30-469d-83a0-e578d886d42d.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026icI98MbZRE1788920026.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5d1c312f-fc30-469d-83a0-e578d886d42d.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_3617aa9a0f3f2b2a-1480\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_3617aa9a0f3f2b2a-1481\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>幸好米雪心態極度豁達，笑言對此「得啖笑」：「其實冇乜所謂，有時話我同你結婚，有時話同佢結婚，或者我哋做好朋友上契，乜都得，大家笑一笑囉，最緊要開心！」其高EQ兼幽默的回應曝光後，獲得大批網民留言大讚：「哈哈，好搞笑」、「好鍾意米雪」、「女神」。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T03:00:12.105032+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":557,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}